---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Página no encontrada | Altaria Lights"
  description="La página que buscas no existe. Vuelve al inicio o descubre los servicios digitales de Altaria Lights."
  canonical={false}
  robots="noindex, follow"
  schema={false}
>
  <main class="not-found">
    <article class="not-found__card">
      <a class="not-found__brand" href="/" aria-label="Volver al inicio de Altaria Lights">
        <img
          src="/brand/optimized/altaria-v2-logo-header-384.webp"
          width="384"
          height="128"
          alt="Altaria Lights"
        />
      </a>
      <p class="not-found__code">Error 404</p>
      <h1>Esta página se ha perdido entre las nubes.</h1>
      <p>La dirección puede haber cambiado o no existir. Puedes volver al inicio o descubrir cómo ayudamos a negocios y empresas.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Opciones para continuar">
        <a class="not-found__primary" href="/">Volver al inicio</a>
        <a href="/servicios">Ver servicios</a>
        <a href="/contacto">Contacto</a>
      </nav>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: clamp(24px, 6vw, 72px) 20px;
    place-items: center;
    color: #103b70;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 13%, rgba(255, 245, 211, 0.88) 0 4%, transparent 4.2%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #69b8e5 0%, #cdeafb 58%, #f8fcff 100%);
  }

  .not-found__card {
    width: min(720px, 100%);
    padding: clamp(30px, 7vw, 72px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border-radius: clamp(34px, 8vw, 72px);
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(250, 253, 255, 0.94);
    box-shadow: 0 34px 80px -52px rgba(8, 53, 99, 0.72);
  }

  .not-found__brand img {
    width: min(230px, 72%);
    height: auto;
  }

  .not-found__code {
    margin: 34px 0 10px;
    font-weight: 780;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: #016ffc;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .not-found h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    color: #0a3267;
  }

  .not-found h1 + p {
    max-width: 54ch;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .not-found nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .not-found nav a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(15, 77, 137, 0.18);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 720;
    color: #0d4f8d;
    background: #f5fbff;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .not-found nav .not-found__primary {
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    background: #0b5598;
  }
</style>
